hat is critical for sphingomyelin synthesis in the Golgi complex (PubMed:39106189)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}